#: ../../language/error_codes/E4118.md:1
msgid "E4118"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4118.md:3
msgid "Cannot match type with map pattern."
msgstr "不能用映射模式匹配此类型。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4118.md:5
msgid ""
"This diagnostic is reported when a map pattern is used on a type without "
"a suitable `get` method. Map patterns on custom types with a `get` method"
" are deprecated; use the standard library's `Map` type instead."
msgstr "对没有合适 `get` 方法的类型使用 map 模式时，会报告此诊断。通过 `get` 方法对自定义类型进行 map 模式匹配的用法已弃用；请改用标准库的 `Map` 类型。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4118.md:8
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4118.md:10
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"priv struct MyMap {}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"test {\n"
"  let map : MyMap = MyMap::{}\n"
"  match map {\n"
"    { \"a\": a, .. } => println(\"a: \\{a}\")\n"
"    //^~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"    // Error: Please implement method `get` for type MyMap to match it "
"with map pattern.\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4118.md:14
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4118.md:17
msgid ""
"Use a `Map` for map-pattern matching, rather than adding a `get` method "
"to a custom type solely to support this syntax."
msgstr "请使用 `Map` 进行 map 模式匹配，而不是仅为支持该语法就给自定义类型添加 `get` 方法。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4118.md:20
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"test {\n"
"  let map : Map[String, Int32] = { \"a\": 1, \"b\": 2, \"c\": 3 }\n"
"  match map {\n"
"    { \"a\": a, .. } => println(\"a: \\{a}\")\n"
"    _ => println(\"missing\")\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
